sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Host as macOS host
  participant Work as kanna3-workd
  participant Mux as kanna3d
  participant Agent as The agent
  Person->>Host: Recall on Build card
  Host->>Work: work.task.recall
  Work->>Work: cancel simulation, draft N+1, What Build tried, recall guess
  Work->>Mux: attach and activate task layout
  Work->>Work: create Recall message thread
  Work->>Mux: gated delivery
  Mux->>Agent: Recall notice when idle and no draft
  Work-->>Host: Desk + guesses + Comments
